OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain continues to push across
OL,6,FScotland, turning heavy at times.
OL,7,FShowers elsewhere with squally rain
OL,8,Fmoving eastwards across England and
OL,9,FWales, locally heavy and thundery near
OL,10,Fsouthern and southwestern coasts.
OL,11,FWindy for many, with a risk of coastal
OL,12,Fgales.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloud and patchy drizzle
OL,15,Facross the north will clear overnight.
OL,16,FClear spells elsewhere, before showery
OL,17,Frain spreads into parts of England and
OL,18,FWales later, becoming heavy and
OL,19,Fsqually at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
