OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA chilly start for many,
OL,6,Fwith heavy showers soon clearing to
OL,7,Fleave a largely dry day with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Turning increasingly unsettled
OL,9,Ffrom the southwest later, as Storm
OL,10,FAusten approaches.
